    rdf:value """a day in Paris to see Mr. Reinach, who was most sympathetic. Logan came soon after. 
I found Bernhard not very well, hard at work over Michelangelo, and very pleasant and delightful. The others were all the same. But the world is strangely different to me now I know the children are happy. """^^xsd:string ;
